{"id":"000VOS","title":"Clasico","author":"iEtsh","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-24T07:22:32+00:00","posted":"Heute, 08:21 Uhr","rules":"Clasico\n\nby iEtsh\n\nRULES\n\nNormal Sudoku\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nPitch Lines (Bouncing Lines)\n\nDigits along the outer white rectangular pitch boundary, the vertical center line of the pitch, and the penalty area (18-yard box) lines for both teams work as bouncing lines and must be strictly monotonic (either all increasing or all decreasing), except when encountering a 1 or a 9, at which point the direction of monotonicity reverses.\n\nScoreboard\n\nThe sum of the cells inside the scoreboard equals the digit in its top-left corner.\n\nPenalty Arc (Dutch Whisper)\n\nThe three cells along the penalty arc in front of each goal act as Dutch Whisper lines, meaning the difference between each consecutive cell must be at least 4.\n\n⚽\n\nFootball Trajectory\n\nThe football and its curved trajectory to the goal act as a circle and a path, and the sum of the cells along the path equals the value of the football cell itself.\n\nCenter Spot\n\nThe center spot cell of the pitch is an odd digit.\n\n🏃\n\nGoalscorer\n\nThe goalscorer's player cell is an odd digit.\n\n▶ Solve Puzzle\n\n🌐 Visit Website for All Puzzles","solutionCode":"Row 9","tags":["Sudoku","Pfeile","Killer (Variante)","Arrows (Variante)","German Whispers (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/r7khdxjd8g","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/r7khdxjd8g","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":1,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-24T07:22:32+00:00"}